              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "CrispClam1072"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I’ve been making a similar salad for years - watermelon, feta, halved kalamata olives, red onion slivers, pepper, very light dressing. It doesn’t sound great but people always want the recipe after. TIP: Add the kalamata at the last minute before serving.",
